#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""Deterministic Borrowed Fire model router.

The router reads private endpoint configuration from Prometheus, sends bounded
local work to the isolated GB10 agent worker, and uses Codex only when policy or
local failure requires paid judgment. Claude is intentionally not a route.
"""

